<attribute name="mainDescription" nodeId="e1328b12">&lt;p&gt;
    Perform the following:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;noindent&quot;&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Review defect documentation and verify defect validity
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Review defects to understand the underlying issue (e.g. wrong data was used, user did not execute the step
        correctly or executed out of order, missing configuration, etc.)
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Perform defect analysis by assigning defect severity, priority and classification
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Route defects for resolution based on analysis to appropriate teams
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
<attribute name="externalId" nodeId="8838b696"></attribute>
<attribute name="keyConsiderations" nodeId="8179d11b"></attribute>
<attribute name="longPresentationName" nodeId="5ca372a"></attribute>
<attribute name="purpose" nodeId="7881f97b">&lt;p&gt;
    The purpose of this task is to:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Understand the defect impact on solution quality
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Investigate defect origins&amp;nbsp;and address irregularities and inconsistencies in the target solution
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Address defects&amp;nbsp;in the most optimal order within timing and schedule constraints&lt;br /&gt;
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
<attribute name="alternatives" nodeId="994e7826"></attribute>
</Element>
